Macarius Vesper is the second in command of [[Org/The Scale/index|the Scale]] and Custode of the Order of the Everchain. He heads its Puritan sect, which holds that the weapons of an enemy are the weapons of the enemy. [[Org/The Scale/People/Lance Vesper|Lance Vesper]] names him father.

He mentored [[Org/The Scale/People/Dame Quay|Dame Quay]], though he does not always agree with her methods. He and [[People/Argyle|Argyle]]'s grandmother, who heads the Scale's arbiters, sit on opposite sides of the organization's politics, the Puritans against the reformists of Argyle's family.
